// Guernsey County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Auditor's Pivot Point
// site, the Common Pleas eServices portal and the Daily Jeffersonian) were
// checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * Southeastern Ohio Regional Medical Center joined OhioHealth in 2023 and is
//     now OhioHealth Southeastern Medical Center; seormc.org is a stale legacy site.
//   * The health department now links its own site
//     (guernseycountyhealthdepartment.org) instead of an ODH directory page.
//   * The Board of Elections uses its own site, boe.guernseycounty.gov (moving to
//     612 Steubenville Ave in December 2026); the boe.ohio.gov page no longer loads.
//   * OhioMeansJobs now links the county JFS page; the Sheriff moved to
//     guernseysheriff.gov.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Cambridge MA/UK/MN/MD; the Channel Island of Guernsey ("Visit Guernsey" is the
//   island's tourism board). cambridgecounselingcenter.com and
//   guernseycountyhistory.com now carry spam. cactricounty.org is a Pennsylvania
//   agency. Degenhart Paperweight Museum closed in 2011.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Cambridge, the seat); villages Byesville (the only one with a
//     site), Cumberland, Fairview (partly Belmont), Lore City, Old Washington,
//     Pleasant City, Quaker City and Senecaville. Salesville (2016) and Kimbolton
//     (2005) dissolved. Nineteen townships, none with own sites.
//   * Three school districts: Cambridge City, Rolling Hills and East Guernsey
//     (whose site does not load). East Central Ohio ESC serves the county;
//     Mid-East CTC's Buffalo Campus is in Senecaville.
//   * Shared bodies: Mental Health & Recovery Services Board (Zanesville),
//     SouthEastern Ohio Joint Solid Waste District (Caldwell), OMEGA regional
//     council, Mid-East Ohio Building Department (Zanesville).
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * East Guernsey Local Schools: site fails with a certificate error.
//   * Land bank, port authority, CIC, SEAT transit: no own websites found.
//   * Ohio University Eastern: Belmont County campus.

